# ID       : ABOP-005
# Name     : Quadratic modification of the snowflake
# Source   : chapter 1, book page 9, Fig. 1.7b
# Formalism: deterministic turtle string
# Parse    : pass
# Execute  : pass
#
# Original ABOP:
# ABOP | ω : -F
# ABOP | p1    : F -> F+F-F+F
